        "description": {
          "en-US": "The Android app for the Interactive Recipe Reader, which turns recipes into clear steps with\nthe ingredients highlighted and a timer for each step.\n\n* Opens recipe links from other apps and the browser\n* Scans invite and login QR codes\n* Adds scheduled recipes to the calendar\n* Keeps the screen on while you cook\n\nThe app shows the reader's server, so new features mostly arrive without an update."
